<title>ITALY: Italy producer prices unchanged yr/yr in August.</title>
<headline>Italy producer prices unchanged yr/yr in August.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian industrial producer prices were unchanged year-on-year in August, the national statistics institute ISTAT said in a statement.</p>
<p>    PRODUCER PRICES	   Aug 96     July 96	 Aug 95</p>
<p>    Year/year change	  0.0 pct    +0.2 pct    +9.0 pct</p>
<p>    Month/month change     +0.1 pct    -0.2 pct    +0.2 pct</p>
<p>    Index (base 1990=100)   123.8	 123.7	  123.8</p>
<p>Istat gave the following general breakdown:</p>
<p>				   Mo/Mo change (%)    Yr/Yr change (%)</p>
<p>    Consumer goods		   0.0		    +2.4</p>
<p>    Investment goods		+0.1		    +3.7</p>
<p>    Intermediate goods	    +0.1		    -1.8</p>
<p>It gave the following sector-by-sector breakdown:</p>
<p>    Sector			   mo/mo (%)	    yr/yr (%)</p>
<p>    Energy products		 +1.1		    +1.6</p>
<p>    Minerals and metals	   -0.4		   -10.1</p>
<p>    Non-metal minerals	    +0.2		    +0.5</p>
<p>    Metal works			0.0		    +2.4</p>
<p>    Cars and parts		   0.0		    +5.9</p>
<p>    Food, drink and tobacco     -0.1		    +1.4</p>
<p>    Clothing, leather goods     -0.1		    +1.1</p>
<p>    Other goods			0.0		    -2.1</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
